{
  "page/about": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Restorative Justice Hub at the University of California, Berkeley is the subject of this local prototype. Explore the educational materials, see how the archive will be organized, and help shape what the site should make easier to find.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What the Hub brings together</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This prototype makes space for learning about restorative justice, sharing projects and resources, and bringing people into conversation. The Hub’s official mission and current campus relationships are awaiting editorial review.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Hub and the former Center</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The former Berkeley Restorative Justice Center has a place in the <a href=\"/legacy/\">historical archive</a>. See <a href=\"/offerings/\">Offerings</a> for the status of current activities.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Find your way</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/what-is-rj/\">Learn what restorative justice means</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/resources/\">Browse learning resources</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/get-involved/\">Explore ways to participate</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n",
  "page/what-is-rj": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Restorative justice is an approach to harm that asks who was affected, what they need, and who has a responsibility to respond. It invites people to consider what accountability and repair could look like in their situation.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- rj-private-media:start -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{SUPPORT_ID}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"{{SUPPORT_URL}}\" alt=\"{{SUPPORT_ALT}}\" class=\"wp-image-{{SUPPORT_ID}}\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">{{SUPPORT_CAPTION}}</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- rj-private-media:end -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Start by listening</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A restorative conversation leaves room for people to describe their experiences in their own words. A facilitator can help participants agree on how to share time, listen, and take a break. Participation and disclosure should be voluntary.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Recognize harm and responsibility</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>People can experience the same event differently. Listening to those perspectives can help clarify what happened and identify concrete needs. Accountability can include acknowledging harm, agreeing to actions, and checking whether those actions are carried out.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Choose practices with care</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A circle is one possible way to structure a conversation. Participants should be able to pass or leave, and a process should be planned with safety, consent, accessibility, and power differences in mind.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This introduction was written for the prototype. It is available for editorial review.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"/resource/questions-for-restorative-reflection/\">Read the reflection questions</a> or <a href=\"/resources/\">browse the resource collection</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
  "page/blog": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Read stories, reflections, and news from the Hub as they become available. The editorial team can review dates, bylines, and publication status before adding articles from the previous site.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:rj-hub/archive {\"collection\":\"blog\"} /-->\n",
  "page/projects": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Explore restorative justice research, teaching, and community work as project records are added. Each record can carry its own credits, citations, links, and documents.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:rj-hub/archive {\"collection\":\"projects\"} /-->\n",
  "page/resources": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Explore reading and discussion materials for learning about restorative justice. Starter resources are labeled for prototype review.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:rj-hub/archive {\"collection\":\"resources\"} /-->\n",
  "page/maps": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This research space is for documented histories of violence against Indigenous peoples in California. Verified records will connect places to nation-specific context, date or date range, and sources for further reading.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Content note:</strong> This collection concerns killings and other violence against Indigenous peoples.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:rj-hub/map /-->\n",
  "page/offerings": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Offerings under review.</strong> Current services, eligibility, and availability are awaiting approval.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Historical programming from the former Berkeley Restorative Justice Center belongs in the <a href=\"/legacy/\">Legacy archive</a>. See <a href=\"/intake/\">Intake and requests</a> for the status of the proposed request pathway.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- rj-private-media:start -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{WORKSHOP_ID}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{WORKSHOP_URL}}\" alt=\"{{WORKSHOP_ALT}}\" class=\"wp-image-{{WORKSHOP_ID}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">{{WORKSHOP_CAPTION}}</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- rj-private-media:end -->\n\n<!-- wp:rj-hub/archive {\"collection\":\"offerings\"} /-->\n",
  "page/community-partners": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This directory will list organizations after the Hub confirms the relationship, description, and preferred links with each organization.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:rj-hub/archive {\"collection\":\"partners\"} /-->\n",
  "page/get-involved": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Interested in restorative justice as a student, educator, researcher, or community member? Start with the <a href=\"/what-is-rj/\">introduction</a> or explore the <a href=\"/resources/\">resource collection</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Student participation</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Hub is reviewing student opportunities and the appropriate contact pathway. Confirmed opportunities can be listed here with eligibility, timing, and application details.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"/contact/\">See the contact page</a> for the status of public inquiries.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
  "page/intake": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This preview shows where request information could live. An intake process requires approval of services, notice and consent, data retention, and who may access requests.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:rj-hub/intake /-->\n",
  "page/legacy": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This archive is reserved for historical records about the former Berkeley Restorative Justice Center. Historical descriptions and images will be dated and credited as the records are reviewed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- rj-private-media:start -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{ARCHIVAL_ID}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{ARCHIVAL_URL}}\" alt=\"{{ARCHIVAL_ALT}}\" class=\"wp-image-{{ARCHIVAL_ID}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">{{ARCHIVAL_CAPTION}}</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- rj-private-media:end -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Historical materials</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Archived program descriptions, articles, and photographs are awaiting source and rights review. See <a href=\"/offerings/\">Offerings</a> for current service status.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
  "page/contact": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Hub is reviewing its public contact details. Contact information will be added here when a designated mailbox and response process are confirmed.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"/intake/\">Read the status of intake and requests</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
  "page/accessibility": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Hub aims to make its materials usable with a keyboard, at different screen sizes, and with assistive technology. This prototype is undergoing accessibility review.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ways to navigate</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use the skip link to move to the main content.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use the main navigation or the home page’s links to browse by topic.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Use the location list on the <a href=\"/maps/\">Maps</a> page to explore any published map records as text.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Accessibility feedback</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The public process for reporting an accessibility issue is awaiting confirmation. See the <a href=\"/contact/\">contact page</a> for the latest status.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
  "page/privacy": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is a local review prototype. Its intake demo has no submission workflow. Please keep real personal or case information out of the preview.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Future intake and publication</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Review of the privacy notice, consent process, retention rules, and access controls is required before accepting requests. An approved privacy notice can be published here.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
  "page/home": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-home-hero\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"},\"tagName\":\"section\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group rj-home-hero\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-hero-inner\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-hero-inner\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-hero-copy\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-hero-copy\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"rj-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"rj-eyebrow\">University of California, Berkeley</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Restorative<br>Justice Hub</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"rj-home-intro\"} -->\n<p class=\"rj-home-intro\">Explore restorative justice at UC Berkeley through the practices of listening, dialogue, and accountability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n<!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/what-is-rj/\">What is restorative justice?</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/about/\">About the Hub</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- rj-private-media:start -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{HERO_ID}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"rj-hero-photo\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full rj-hero-photo\"><img src=\"{{HERO_URL}}\" alt=\"{{HERO_ALT}}\" class=\"wp-image-{{HERO_ID}}\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">{{HERO_CAPTION}}</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- rj-private-media:end -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-section rj-explore\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"},\"tagName\":\"section\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group rj-section rj-explore\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-section-intro\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-section-intro\">\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Explore the Hub</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Learn about restorative justice and find projects and resources for further study.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-orbit-frame\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-orbit-frame\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"rj-orbit-center\"} -->\n<p class=\"rj-orbit-center\">RJ Hub</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"rj-orbit\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list rj-orbit\">\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/what-is-rj/\">What is RJ?</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/projects/\">Projects</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/maps/\">Historical map</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/offerings/\">Offerings</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/community-partners/\">Community partners</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:details {\"className\":\"rj-orbit-alternative\"} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details rj-orbit-alternative\"><summary>View destinations as a list</summary>\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/what-is-rj/\">What is RJ?</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/projects/\">Projects</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/maps/\">Historical map</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/offerings/\">Offerings</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/community-partners/\">Community partners</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n</details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-section rj-pathways\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"},\"tagName\":\"section\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group rj-section rj-pathways\">\n<!-- rj-private-media:start -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{SUPPORT_ID}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"rj-support-photo\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full rj-support-photo\"><img src=\"{{SUPPORT_URL}}\" alt=\"{{SUPPORT_ALT}}\" class=\"wp-image-{{SUPPORT_ID}}\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">{{SUPPORT_CAPTION}}</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- rj-private-media:end -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-pathways-copy\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-pathways-copy\">\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Keep learning</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Find reading and viewing materials, or see how to get involved with the Hub.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n<!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/resources/\">Browse resources</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/get-involved/\">Get involved</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-section rj-journal\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"},\"tagName\":\"section\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group rj-section rj-journal\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-split-heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-split-heading\">\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Latest from the blog</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"rj-path-link\"} -->\n<p class=\"rj-path-link\"><a href=\"/blog/\">All posts</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:query {\"queryId\":0,\"query\":{\"perPage\":3,\"pages\":0,\"offset\":0,\"postType\":\"post\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"orderBy\":\"date\",\"inherit\":false}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-query\">\n<!-- wp:post-template {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"columnCount\":3}} -->\n<!-- wp:post-date {\"format\":\"F j, Y\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:post-title {\"level\":3,\"isLink\":true} /-->\n<!-- wp:post-excerpt {\"excerptLength\":24} /-->\n<!-- /wp:post-template -->\n<!-- wp:query-no-results -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Browse the Blog for updates as articles are added.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:query-no-results -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:query -->\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n",
  "page/home-alternate": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-alternate-hero\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"},\"tagName\":\"section\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group rj-alternate-hero\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-alternate-head\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-alternate-head\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"rj-eyebrow\"} -->\n<p class=\"rj-eyebrow\">University of California, Berkeley</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Restorative Justice Hub</h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"rj-home-intro\"} -->\n<p class=\"rj-home-intro\">Explore restorative justice at UC Berkeley through the practices of listening, dialogue, and accountability.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n<!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/what-is-rj/\">Explore restorative justice</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/about/\">About the Hub</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- rj-private-media:start -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{HERO_ID}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"rj-alternate-photo\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full rj-alternate-photo\"><img src=\"{{HERO_URL}}\" alt=\"{{HERO_ALT}}\" class=\"wp-image-{{HERO_ID}}\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">{{HERO_CAPTION}}</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- rj-private-media:end -->\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-section rj-pathways\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"},\"tagName\":\"section\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group rj-section rj-pathways\">\n<!-- rj-private-media:start -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{SUPPORT_ID}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"rj-support-photo\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full rj-support-photo\"><img src=\"{{SUPPORT_URL}}\" alt=\"{{SUPPORT_ALT}}\" class=\"wp-image-{{SUPPORT_ID}}\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">{{SUPPORT_CAPTION}}</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- rj-private-media:end -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-pathways-copy\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-pathways-copy\">\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Keep learning</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Find reading and viewing materials, or see how to get involved with the Hub.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n<!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/resources/\">Browse resources</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/get-involved/\">Get involved</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-section rj-explore\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"},\"tagName\":\"section\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group rj-section rj-explore\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-section-intro\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-section-intro\">\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Explore the Hub</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Learn about restorative justice and find projects and resources for further study.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-orbit-frame\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-orbit-frame\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"rj-orbit-center\"} -->\n<p class=\"rj-orbit-center\">RJ Hub</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"rj-orbit\"} -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list rj-orbit\">\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/what-is-rj/\">What is RJ?</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/projects/\">Projects</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/maps/\">Historical map</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/offerings/\">Offerings</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/community-partners/\">Community partners</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:details {\"className\":\"rj-orbit-alternative\"} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details rj-orbit-alternative\"><summary>View destinations as a list</summary>\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/what-is-rj/\">What is RJ?</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/projects/\">Projects</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/maps/\">Historical map</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/offerings/\">Offerings</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/community-partners/\">Community partners</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/blog/\">Blog</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n</details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-section rj-journal\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"},\"tagName\":\"section\"} -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group rj-section rj-journal\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-split-heading\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-split-heading\">\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Latest from the blog</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"rj-path-link\"} -->\n<p class=\"rj-path-link\"><a href=\"/blog/\">All posts</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:query {\"queryId\":0,\"query\":{\"perPage\":3,\"pages\":0,\"offset\":0,\"postType\":\"post\",\"order\":\"desc\",\"orderBy\":\"date\",\"inherit\":false}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-query\">\n<!-- wp:post-template {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"columnCount\":3}} -->\n<!-- wp:post-date {\"format\":\"F j, Y\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:post-title {\"level\":3,\"isLink\":true} /-->\n<!-- wp:post-excerpt {\"excerptLength\":24} /-->\n<!-- /wp:post-template -->\n<!-- wp:query-no-results -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Browse the Blog for updates as articles are added.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:query-no-results -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:query -->\n</section>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n",
  "page/style-guide": "<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-guide-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-guide-section\">\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Color</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-palette\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-palette\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-swatch rj-swatch-rj-blue\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-swatch rj-swatch-rj-blue\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>RJ Hub blue<br><code>#1a307d</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-swatch rj-swatch-deep-blue\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-swatch rj-swatch-deep-blue\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Deep blue<br><code>#022676</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-swatch rj-swatch-off-white\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-swatch rj-swatch-off-white\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Off-white<br><code>#fcffff</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-swatch rj-swatch-secondary-blue\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-swatch rj-swatch-secondary-blue\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Secondary blue<br><code>#405396</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-swatch rj-swatch-black\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-swatch rj-swatch-black\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Black<br><code>#000000</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-swatch rj-swatch-deep-teal\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-swatch rj-swatch-deep-teal\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Deep teal<br><code>#254857</code></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use dark blue or black type on off-white. Reserve off-white type for dark surfaces, such as the primary-blue button.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:table -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Text</th><th scope=\"col\">Background</th><th scope=\"col\">WCAG contrast</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>RJ Hub blue</td><td>Off-white</td><td>11.85:1</td></tr><tr><td>Deep blue</td><td>Off-white</td><td>13.55:1</td></tr><tr><td>Secondary blue</td><td>Off-white</td><td>7.21:1</td></tr><tr><td>Deep teal</td><td>Off-white</td><td>9.75:1</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<!-- /wp:table -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-guide-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-guide-section\">\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Type and editorial hierarchy</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">A practice of listening</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Noto Serif is the licensed display substitute for Brixton. Times New Roman supports longer educational text and citations. The interface uses the system sans serif.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:quote -->\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use a block quotation for documented wording and add the verified source in the citation field.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</blockquote>\n<!-- /wp:quote -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-guide-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-guide-section\">\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Links, controls, and layout</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use descriptive links, one primary action per section, and visible keyboard focus. Use the page heading for the title and let subsequent headings follow a logical order.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n<!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/about/\">About the Hub</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"/blog/\">Read the blog</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-teaser-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-teaser-card\">\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Resource card</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use a short description on archive cards and a descriptive label for the resource link.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"/resources/\">Open resource archive</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:search {\"label\":\"Search the site\",\"showLabel\":true,\"buttonText\":\"Search\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:details -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details\"><summary>View the standard layouts</summary>\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/\">Mission-led home page</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/home-alternate/\">Photo-led alternate</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/what-is-rj/\">Educational article</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"/projects/\">Project archive</a></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n</ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n</details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Section padding adapts to the viewport. Standard reading pages have a maximum line width of 46rem.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"rj-guide-section rj-guide-media\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group rj-guide-section rj-guide-media\">\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Logo and photography</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The combined circular brushstroke and RJ Hub lettering can be previewed in the header when local review media is enabled. The mark is extracted from the supplied PDF and is provisional pending an approved transparent master.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Keep generous clear space around the mark. For editorial photographs, write alt text for the scene, and use a caption for review status, credit and verified context.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- rj-private-media:start -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{MARK_ID}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"rj-guide-logo\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full rj-guide-logo\"><img src=\"{{MARK_URL}}\" alt=\"{{MARK_ALT}}\" class=\"wp-image-{{MARK_ID}}\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">{{MARK_CAPTION}}</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- rj-private-media:end -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Editorial image crop</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- rj-private-media:start -->\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{SUPPORT_ID}},\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"rj-support-photo\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full rj-support-photo\"><img src=\"{{SUPPORT_URL}}\" alt=\"{{SUPPORT_ALT}}\" class=\"wp-image-{{SUPPORT_ID}}\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">{{SUPPORT_CAPTION}}</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<!-- rj-private-media:end -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n",
  "wp_navigation/rj-hub-primary": "<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"About\",\"url\":\"/about/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"What is RJ?\",\"url\":\"/what-is-rj/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Projects\",\"url\":\"/projects/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Maps\",\"url\":\"/maps/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Offerings\",\"url\":\"/offerings/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Partners\",\"url\":\"/community-partners/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Resources\",\"url\":\"/resources/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Blog\",\"url\":\"/blog/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Get involved\",\"url\":\"/get-involved/\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->\n",
  "rj_resource/questions-for-restorative-reflection": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>These prompts introduce questions that can guide reflection after harm. Use them for study or discussion in a setting where people can choose how much to share.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Understand what happened</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>How do people describe the situation from their own perspectives?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Who was affected, and what impacts have they identified?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What information or support would help people participate by choice?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consider repair</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>What would help address the harm now?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Who is able to take responsibility for each next step?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>How can people check whether the agreed steps have been carried out?</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Prepared for editorial review in the RJ Hub local prototype. <a href=\"/what-is-rj/\">Read the introduction to restorative justice</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n",
  "rj_resource/planning-an-accessible-discussion": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Use this checklist to think through accessibility before a group discussion. Ask participants what helps them take part, and give people time to respond.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Before the discussion</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Share the topic, format, and materials ahead of time.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Check that people can reach the space and move around it comfortably.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Offer materials in a format participants can use with assistive technology.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">During the discussion</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Explain how to take a turn, pass, or ask for a break.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Offer more than one way to contribute where practical.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Summarize next steps in plain language and provide a way to review them later.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Prepared for editorial review in the RJ Hub local prototype. <a href=\"/accessibility/\">Read about accessibility on this site</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n"
}
